  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FPCCIA &#xE4;r en paraplyorganisation med ca 20 lokala handelskammare som medlemmar. Insatsen avser st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r en inledande fas av ett program som syftar till att st&#xE4;rka FPCCIAs kapacitet att ge service till medelmmarna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Federation of Palestine Chambers of Commerce, Industry and Agriculture, FPCCIA, is the umbrella organisation for around 20 sector chambers in Palestine. The support is for an inception phase of a program that aims to strengthen the capacity of FPCCIA to services its members.</narrative>
  </description>
